                  "declaration": "useUpdateProfile",
                  "reading": "The author modified the `onSuccess` callback in the function `useUpdateProfile()` that:\n\n- no longer writes the profile that [`updateProfile()`](code:src/api/profile.ts#L8-10) returns into the query cache, and takes no parameter\n- calls `queryClient.invalidateQueries()` with the key `[\"profile\"]`, the key of the query in [`useProfile()`](code:src/hooks/use-profile.ts#L6-8), so that the query calls [`fetchProfile()`](code:src/api/profile.ts#L4-6) again while `AccountPage` in `src/routes/account/index.tsx` is mounted\n- does not return the promise of `invalidateQueries()`, because of `void`, so the mutation is not pending while the profile loads again\n\n`ProfileForm` in `src/routes/account/components/ProfileForm.tsx` saves through this mutation, so after a save the profile in the cache is the response of a read of `/api/profile`, not the response of the `PUT`.",
